+/-- Shared file rows acknowledge just those original lines, not an entire
+owner or raw result. The caller supplies facts from its checked pre-read index.
+No new original is inferred from an ACK, a plan key or a file locator. -/
+def presentationWithShared (known : Knowledge) (stored : Array Read) (shown : Presentation) : Presentation :=
+  if known.uncertain then shown else
+    {shown with ranges := shown.ranges ++ (SharedReadReceipt.collect known.acknowledged stored).map (·.range)}
